00:25:02.139 --> 00:25:04.409
Because, you know, philanthropy,

00:25:04.409 --> 00:25:06.469
doesn't always have the same
type of objective function

00:25:06.469 --> 00:25:07.819
that you can get in the investing world

00:25:07.819 --> 00:25:08.949
of the for-profit world,

00:25:08.949 --> 00:25:10.879
where you can say, oh, I
put this much money in,

00:25:10.879 --> 00:25:11.922
and I got this much money back

00:25:11.922 --> 00:25:14.192
and philanthropy, you're
putting some Dollars

00:25:14.192 --> 00:25:16.250
and potentially time and
effort and energy in,

00:25:16.250 --> 00:25:18.520
and there is a return and impact,

00:25:18.520 --> 00:25:21.074
but how do you think
about that and how do you,

00:25:21.074 --> 00:25:22.500
what advice you have for people

00:25:22.500 --> 00:25:23.854
both children

00:25:23.854 --> 00:25:27.262
or other philanthropists
like yourself to do it well?

00:25:28.357 --> 00:25:32.729
- Well, I, you know,
first of all, I, you know,

00:25:32.729 --> 00:25:34.440
particularly for younger folks,

00:25:34.440 --> 00:25:36.839
you know, I would put, you know,

00:25:36.839 --> 00:25:38.709
a little more of the emphasis on time

00:25:38.709 --> 00:25:39.892
rather than Dollars

00:25:39.892 --> 00:25:42.272
because you see, you know, just,

00:25:42.272 --> 00:25:44.686
you know, making a donation
to an organization,

00:25:44.686 --> 00:25:49.499
you know, it's wonderful.

00:25:49.499 --> 00:25:50.589
You should do that.

00:25:50.589 --> 00:25:52.104
You know, as Sal mentioned

00:25:52.104 --> 00:25:55.149
the Khan Academy has a donate page,

00:25:55.149 --> 00:25:57.529
and I think everyone now
should click over there,

00:25:57.529 --> 00:25:58.713
but there's something even,

00:25:58.713 --> 00:26:00.863
I think, more transformative,

00:26:00.863 --> 00:26:03.520
if you actually put your time into it

00:26:03.520 --> 00:26:05.509
and putting your time into it

00:26:05.509 --> 00:26:08.419
will actually make you
more likely to wanna put

00:26:08.419 --> 00:26:09.857
your Dollars into it.

00:26:09.857 --> 00:26:12.539
And you know,

00:26:12.539 --> 00:26:16.139
young kids generally have
more time than Dollars.

00:26:16.139 --> 00:26:19.010
And so I think that there's an opportunity

00:26:19.010 --> 00:26:24.010
to get the youth involved
with philanthropy,

00:26:26.151 --> 00:26:29.569
by picking community service activities.

00:26:29.569 --> 00:26:30.402
That by the way,

00:26:30.402 --> 00:26:32.859
I think that there's a big argument that,

00:26:32.859 --> 00:26:34.219
you know in America,

00:26:34.219 --> 00:26:37.273
we would benefit by having far more

00:26:37.273 --> 00:26:40.986
