in community service.

00:26:40.986 --> 00:26:44.412
I think that this would actually

00:26:44.412 --> 00:26:48.229
in general make a more cohesive society.

00:26:48.229 --> 00:26:51.280
So my recommendation would really be,

00:26:51.280 --> 00:26:53.676
you know, to pick philanthropic

00:26:53.676 --> 00:26:56.138
community service activities.

00:26:56.138 --> 00:26:59.159
And I think as a great
introduction, you know,

00:26:59.159 --> 00:27:00.756
