impact of what you're doing.

00:27:03.569 --> 00:27:04.775
It can be much more direct.

00:27:04.775 --> 00:27:06.491
And then this will, I think,

00:27:06.491 --> 00:27:08.638
convinced even young people

00:27:08.638 --> 00:27:12.068
